{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "按链定确认",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 73.89,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "交易所，每条链单独定入账条件。",
   "spoken": "交易所，每条链单独定入账条件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.532,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 4.63,
   "speechEnd": 7.261
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "以太坊看 finalized 标签，PoW 小链按租算力的成本定确认数。",
   "spoken": "以太坊看 finalized 标签，PoW 小链按租算力的成本定确认数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.328,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 8.426,
   "speechEnd": 13.164
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "区分两种状态，继续出块但不最终确定，和完全停止。",
   "spoken": "区分两种状态，继续出块但不最终确定，和完全停止。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.236,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 14.334,
   "speechEnd": 18.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "最终性延迟或出块间隔超过阈值，自动暂停充提，恢复后逐笔对账。",
   "spoken": "最终性延迟或出块间隔超过阈值，自动暂停充提，恢复后逐笔对账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.928,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 20.026,
   "speechEnd": 25.954
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "运营节点的，至少运行两种客户端，交叉核对。",
   "spoken": "运营节点的，至少运行两种客户端，交叉核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.012,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 27.11,
   "speechEnd": 31.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "普通用户，交易所显示等待确认时，耐心等。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，交易所显示等待确认时，耐心等。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.128,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 32.226,
   "speechEnd": 36.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "链停摆时，不要反复提交交易，恢复后先查状态。",
   "spoken": "链停摆时，不要反复提交交易，恢复后先查状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 37.172,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 37.27,
   "speechEnd": 41.401
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 42.456,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 42.554,
   "speechEnd": 43.768
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "同样的 bug 出在超过三分之一的客户端上，检查点不再最终确定。",
   "spoken": "同样的 bug 出在超过三分之一的客户端上，检查点不再最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.836,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 44.934,
   "speechEnd": 49.517
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "链照样出块，N 个区块的条件照样满足，系统继续入账。",
   "spoken": "链照样出块，N 个区块的条件照样满足，系统继续入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.576,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 50.674,
   "speechEnd": 55.721
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "只有看 finalized 标签、监控最终性延迟的系统，才会停下。",
   "spoken": "只有看 finalized 标签、监控最终性延迟的系统，才会停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.772,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 56.87,
   "speechEnd": 61.453
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "已确认只是一个赌注，先问攻击者控制了什么，再定防线。",
   "spoken": "已确认只是一个赌注，先问攻击者控制了什么，再定防线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 62.512,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 62.61,
   "speechEnd": 66.895
  },
  {
